  "story": {
    "title": "BROTHER AND SISTER",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once upon a time, there was a sister who lived with her brother. The sister's name was Sheetal. The brother's name was Amit. It was a hot day. Sheetal and Amit wanted to play in the lake. Sheetal requested her parents that can we play in the lake? Her parents told her that yes you can go.",
      "Sheetal & Amit played in the lake for some time. Then it was getting dark. They decided to go to there home. The sister wished that if it did not get dark we could play forever. They were very sad & went back home. The parents thought that we should make their favourite dish at dinner.",
      "They became really elated. Then they had their dinner. Then they went to sleep. The next day they got ready, had their breakfast, and went to their room to study. The parents got very happy. Their father went out to buy vegetables to eat. Their father came back.",
      "Their mother cooked delicious food for them. They had a delicious meal after studying. Then after eating their lunch they went out to play in the park near their home.",
      "After they reached the park they met their friend Raju who had also come to the park to play. Sheetal, Amit & Raju had a great time playing in the park. Amit, Sheetal's brother got hurt on his leg on their way home. But Amit managed to come back home.",
      "Their father asked Sheetal what had happened on the way home. Sheetal told how Amit had got hurt on his leg. Their mother them that Amit will get fine & healthy. After a few days, Amit was healthy again. He started walking, running, & jumping.",
      "Thank You"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Once upon a time, there was a sister who lived with her brother.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày xửa ngày xưa, có một người chị sống cùng em trai mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The sister's name was Sheetal.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chị gái tên là Sheetal."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The brother's name was Amit.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Em trai tên là Amit."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was a hot day.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hôm đó trời rất nóng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sheetal and Amit wanted to play in the lake.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sheetal và Amit muốn chơi ở hồ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sheetal requested her parents that can we play in the lake?",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sheetal xin phép bố mẹ: \"Chúng con chơi ở hồ được không ạ?\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her parents told her that yes you can go.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố mẹ nói với cô bé: \"Được, các con đi đi.\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sheetal & Amit played in the lake for some time.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sheetal và Amit chơi ở hồ một lúc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then it was getting dark.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó trời bắt đầu tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They decided to go to there home.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn quyết định về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The sister wished that if it did not get dark we could play forever.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chị gái ước rằng nếu trời không tối thì chúng mình có thể chơi mãi mãi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They were very sad & went back home.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn rất buồn và về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The parents thought that we should make their favourite dish at dinner.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố mẹ nghĩ rằng chúng ta nên làm món ăn yêu thích của các con vào bữa tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They became really elated.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn trở nên rất vui."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then they had their dinner.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó, hai bạn ăn bữa tối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then they went to sleep.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Rồi hai bạn đi ngủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The next day they got ready, had their breakfast, and went to their room to study.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày hôm sau, hai bạn chuẩn bị, ăn sáng, rồi vào phòng học bài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The parents got very happy.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố mẹ rất vui."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Their father went out to buy vegetables to eat.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố ra ngoài mua rau củ về ăn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Their father came back.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố đã về."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Their mother cooked delicious food for them.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ nấu món ăn ngon cho hai bạn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They had a delicious meal after studying.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn có một bữa ăn ngon sau khi học bài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then after eating their lunch they went out to play in the park near their home.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau khi ăn trưa xong, hai bạn ra công viên gần nhà chơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After they reached the park they met their friend Raju who had also come to the park to play.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau khi đến công viên, hai bạn gặp bạn Raju cũng đến công viên chơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sheetal, Amit & Raju had a great time playing in the park.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sheetal, Amit và Raju đã có một khoảng thời gian vui vẻ khi chơi ở công viên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Amit, Sheetal's brother got hurt on his leg on their way home.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Amit, em trai của Sheetal, bị thương ở chân trên đường về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But Amit managed to come back home.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng Amit vẫn cố gắng về được đến nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Their father asked Sheetal what had happened on the way home.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố hỏi Sheetal chuyện gì đã xảy ra trên đường về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sheetal told how Amit had got hurt on his leg.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sheetal kể lại Amit đã bị thương ở chân như thế nào."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Their mother them that Amit will get fine & healthy.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ nói với hai bạn rằng Amit sẽ khỏe lại thôi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "After a few days, Amit was healthy again.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_030.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vài ngày sau, Amit lại khỏe mạnh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He started walking, running, & jumping.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_031.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé bắt đầu đi bộ, chạy và nhảy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Thank You",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_143942/s_032.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cảm ơn."
      }
    ]
  },
